<template><section class="technical-evidence" aria-label="日线技术依据"><h3>日线技术依据</h3><p>模型材料使用指标、来源版本和日线内容指纹；完整日线可在下方核对，固定报告仍保存原始行。</p><p v-if="!evidence||evidence.status==='missing'">尚无已保存日线。可在连接设置主动查询并确认保存。</p><template v-else><p>{{ evidence.source?.source }} · {{ evidence.source?.symbol }} · {{ evidence.source?.currency }} · 截止 {{ evidence.source?.as_of }} · {{ evidence.source?.candles.length }} 根</p><p>获取时间 {{ evidence.source?.retrieved_at }} · 保存版本 {{ evidence.source?.revision }}</p><p v-if="evidence.status==='stale'">日线已超过三日或日期异常，仅保留来源，不作为当前技术依据。</p><p v-else-if="evidence.status==='refresh_required'">日期已变化，请重新载入材料后查看当前指标。</p><template v-else-if="evidence.technical"><p>趋势：{{ trends[String(evidence.technical.trend)]||'待补' }} · RSI14：{{ evidence.technical.rsi14===null&&(evidence.source?.candles.length||0)>=15?'观察窗口无涨跌，未定义':show(evidence.technical.rsi14) }}</p><p>支撑：{{ show(evidence.technical.support) }} · 压力：{{ show(evidence.technical.resistance) }} · {{ evidence.source?.currency }}</p><dl><template v-for="(value,key) in evidence.technical.moving_averages" :key="key"><dt>{{ String(key).toUpperCase() }}</dt><dd>{{ show(value) }}</dd></template></dl><p>ATR14：{{ show(evidence.technical.atr14) }} · 20日量比：{{ show(evidence.technical.volume_ratio20) }}</p><p>MACD：{{ show(evidence.technical.macd?.line) }} / 信号 {{ show(evidence.technical.macd?.signal) }} / 柱 {{ show(evidence.technical.macd?.histogram) }}</p><section v-if="evidence.market_signals?.length" class="technical-signals"><h4>价格行为条件提示</h4><article v-for="signal in evidence.market_signals" :key="signal.code"><strong>{{ signal.title['zh-CN'] }}</strong><p>{{ signal.suggested_action['zh-CN'] }}</p><details><summary>计算依据</summary><pre>{{ signal.evidence }}</pre></details></article></section><p v-if="evidence.status==='partial'">历史不足20根，当前为部分指标，缺失不填零。</p></template></template><p>{{ evidence?.notice||'技术指标不是投资判断；未复权日线可能受拆股分红影响。' }}</p><details v-if="evidence?.source"><summary>核对固定日线来源</summary><pre>{{ evidence.source.candles }}</pre></details></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import type {TechnicalEvidence} from '@/api/researchTechnical'
defineProps<{evidence:TechnicalEvidence|null|undefined}>()
const show=(value:unknown)=>value===null||value===undefined?'待补':String(value)
const trends:Record<string,string>={bullish:'上行排列',bearish:'下行排列',range:'区间',insufficient:'历史不足'}
</script>
<style scoped>.technical-evidence{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);border-radius:12px;margin:12px 0}.technical-evidence p{line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.technical-evidence dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.technical-evidence dd{margin:0}.technical-evidence pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px}</style>
